## Methodological Declaration

This synthesis was produced by automated analysis of seven large language model persona outputs. All citations should be independently verified before use in academic publication or formal policy submission. The synthesis is intended for research scoping and improvement agenda prioritisation. It does not constitute a systematic review. Where evidence is cited as strong, this reflects the consensus of persona outputs and a reasonable assessment of study design and replication — not a formal GRADE evaluation. Health inequalities considerations have been embedded throughout in accordance with the NHS CORE20PLUS5 framework and Marmot Review principles.